// Public API surface for the `toolchain` library dependency.
//
// PR3-D scaffold (R3 trajectory after #1886 cross-pkg dispatch arm
// landed): exposes a minimal `[lib]` entry so downstream crates (e.g.
// `cmd/osty-native-checker`) can declare `toolchain` as a path
// dependency and `use toolchain.check`.
//
// Until `cmd/osty` grows a real lib build path (PR3-E), this file is a
// minimal marker; the actual exports come from the rest of the package
// once the manifest is wired up. The real cross-package method-call
// dispatch needs `checkLookupFn` to consult the dependency's symbol
// table (cross-env extension) — that lives outside the narrow
// exception's per-arm scope and is tracked separately.
